* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_cmp2: double-tail dynamic comparator, revision 2 (low noise). Same topology as r1_cmp.
* PMOS input pair 48u/0.3u ng=12; integration nodes dip/din loaded by PMOS gate capacitors 16u/4u
* (gate on the node, source/drain/bulk at VDD: inverted channel while the node is below VDD-|VT|), which sets
* the integration time and therefore the noise bandwidth. Reset devices 2u.
* clk=1, clkb=0: evaluate. clk=0: reset, outp = outn = VDD. inp > inn -> outp stays high.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_cmp2_s1 inp inn dip din clkb vbp vdd gnd wi=48u li=0.3u ngi=12 wt=16u wtc=16u ltc=0.5u
* first (integrating) stage of r1_cmp2; separate so that the noise deck can bias dip/din externally.
* Tail = switch XMT1 (clkb) in series with current source XMTC (gate vbp from r1_cmp2_bias): the integration
* current, and therefore the integration time and noise, stays nearly constant while the input common mode
* falls from 0.6 V to 0.1 V during monotonic switching.
XMT1 tail0 clkb vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wt} l=0.13u ng=4 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMTC tail  vbp  tail0 vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wtc} l={ltc} ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XM1  dip  inp  tail vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XM2  din  inn  tail vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wi} l={li} ng={ngi} m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
.ends r1_cmp2_s1

.subckt r1_cmp2 inp inn clk clkb outp outn vbp vdd gnd wi=48u li=0.3u ngi=12 wt=16u wtc=16u ltc=0.5u wcap=16u lcap=4u wr=2u wh=8u
XS1  inp inn dip din clkb vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2_s1 wi={wi} li={li} ngi={ngi} wt={wt} wtc={wtc} ltc={ltc}
XCI1 vdd  dip  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XCI2 vdd  din  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wcap} l={lcap} ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMR1 dip  clkb gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMR2 din  clkb gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w={wr} l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMT2 lt   clk  gnd  gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMN1 outp outn lt   gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMN2 outn outp lt   gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMP1 outp outn vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMP2 outn outp vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMH1 outp dip  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMH2 outn din  vdd  vdd sg13_lv_pmos w={wh} l=0.13u ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XBP1 outpb outp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XBN1 outpb outp gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XBP2 outnb outn vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XBN2 outnb outn gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
Cbp outpb gnd 3f
Cbn outnb gnd 3f
.ends r1_cmp2

* r1_cmp2_bias: bias of the comparator tail current sources. ib = ideal reference current (stands in for the
* bandgap-derived bias current; labelled ideal in the run records). Diode XMBD with w = wtc / 20.
.subckt r1_cmp2_bias vbp vdd gnd ib=14u
Ibc vbp gnd {ib}
XMBD vbp vbp vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=0.8u l=0.5u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
.ends r1_cmp2_bias

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_th2: one revision-2 track-and-hold slice (CDAC P and N, top-plate sampling).
* in0 sampled while trk0=1, in1 while trk1=1 (never both); sample on the falling edge. lsb nodes reset
* to VREF while either path tracks. cpK/cnK = 1: bottom plate K of side P/N goes VREF -> GND.
* Full variant: both input pairs with complete bootstrapped switches; transistor drivers r1_drv.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_th2 in0p in0n in1p in1n trk0 trk1 top_p top_n cp11 cp10 cp9 cp8 cp7 cp6 cp5 cp4 cp3 cp2 cp1 cp0 cn11 cn10 cn9 cn8 cn7 cn6 cn5 cn4 cn3 cn2 cn1 cn0 vdd vref gnd
XPT0a t0b trk0 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNT0a t0b trk0 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XPT0b t0 t0b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNT0b t0 t0b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XPT1a t1b trk1 vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNT1a t1b trk1 gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XPT1b t1 t1b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=4u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNT1b t1 t1b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=2u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XS0P in0p top_p t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS0N in0n top_n t0 t0b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS1P in1p top_p t1 t1b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XS1N in1n top_n t1 t1b vdd gnd r1_bootsw
XPR1 rstb_n t0b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XPR2 rstb_n t1b vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNR1 rstb_n t0b nr gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNR2 nr t1b gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XPR3 rstb rstb_n vdd vdd sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XNR3 rstb rstb_n gnd gnd sg13_lv_nmos w=0.5u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XLRP lsb_p rstb vref vref sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XLRN lsb_n rstb vref vref sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=0.13u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XDACP top_p lsb_p bp11 bp10 bp9 bp8 bp7 bp6 bp5 bp4 bp3 bp2 bp1 bp0 r1_cdac2_side
XDACN top_n lsb_n bn11 bn10 bn9 bn8 bn7 bn6 bn5 bn4 bn3 bn2 bn1 bn0 r1_cdac2_side
XDp11 cp11 bp11 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
XDp10 cp10 bp10 vref gnd r1_drv wp=2u wn=1u
