* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc2_core: R1 ADC revision-2 core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* Frame (30 cycles of 30 MHz): A decides in cycles 0-12, B in 13-25; A tracks 13-29, B tracks 26-29.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc2_core sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 mclk wina winb lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trka0 trka1 topap topan cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vref gnd r1_th2
XCBIAS vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2_bias
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trkb0 trkb1 topbp topbn cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vref gnd r1_th2
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2
XSAR oap oan obp obn mclk wina winb trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 clka clkab clkb clkbb cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 rawa rawb vdd gnd r1_sar2_logic
.ends r1_adc2_core

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc2_core_fast: R1 ADC revision-2 core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* Frame (30 cycles of 30 MHz): A decides in cycles 0-12, B in 13-25; A tracks 13-29, B tracks 26-29.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc2_core_fast sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 mclk wina winb lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trka0 trka1 topap topan cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vref gnd r1_th2_fast
XCBIAS vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2_bias
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2
XTHB cosp cosn isbp isbn trkb0 trkb1 topbp topbn cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 vdd vref gnd r1_th2_fast
XCMPB topbp topbn clkb clkbb obp obn vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2
XSAR oap oan obp obn mclk wina winb trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 clka clkab clkb clkbb cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 rawa rawb vdd gnd r1_sar2_logic
.ends r1_adc2_core_fast

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_adc2_core_fast_a: R1 ADC revision-2 core. Slice A: in0 = SIN, in1 = ISA. Slice B: in0 = COS, in1 = ISB.
* Slice A only (slice B and comparator B removed, comparator-B inputs of the SAR logic tied); static decks.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_adc2_core_fast_a sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isbp isbn trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 mclk wina winb lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref gnd
XTHA sinp sinn isap isan trka0 trka1 topap topan cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 vdd vref gnd r1_th2_fast
XCBIAS vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2_bias
XCMPA topap topan clka clkab oap oan vbp vdd gnd r1_cmp2
Vtieb1 obp gnd 1.2
Vtieb2 obn gnd 0
Rtb1 topbp gnd 1e9
Rtb2 topbn gnd 1e9
XSAR oap oan obp obn mclk wina winb trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 lata latb stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13 stb14 stb15 stb16 stb17 stb18 stb19 stb20 stb21 stb22 stb23 stb24 stb25 clka clkab clkb clkbb cpa11 cpa10 cpa9 cpa8 cpa7 cpa6 cpa5 cpa4 cpa3 cpa2 cpa1 cpa0 cna11 cna10 cna9 cna8 cna7 cna6 cna5 cna4 cna3 cna2 cna1 cna0 cpb11 cpb10 cpb9 cpb8 cpb7 cpb6 cpb5 cpb4 cpb3 cpb2 cpb1 cpb0 cnb11 cnb10 cnb9 cnb8 cnb7 cnb6 cnb5 cnb4 cnb3 cnb2 cnb1 cnb0 rawa rawb vdd gnd r1_sar2_logic
.ends r1_adc2_core_fast_a

* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* r1_refbuf: ADC reference buffer, 1.0 V from the bandgap node (vbg = 1.045 V, G1 lineage; ideal in the decks).
*  divider: 23 equal rhigh segments (w 1 um, l 10 um), tap 22/23 from ground: 0.99957 V; ~3 uA from vbg.
*  error amplifier (VDDA 3.3 V, thick oxide): HV NMOS pair (+ vtap, - vref), HV PMOS mirror, tail = 2 x bias.
*  output stage: HV NMOS source follower (drain VDDA, msf x 4 x 10/0.45 um) sunk by an HV NMOS mirror of
*  mib x the bias current at vref; gate node held by a MIM capacitor (cg MIM cells of 50 x 50 um, 3.76 pF each)
*  so that the fast CDAC charge is served by the follower (1/gm) and the decoupling capacitor.
*  decoupling: ndec MIM cells of 70 x 70 um (7.36 pF each) on vref.
*  bias: ibias (ideal 5 uA reference current; stands in for the bandgap-derived iptat bias).
* Ports: vbg vref vdda gnd.
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt r1_refbuf vbg vref vdda gnd msf=8 mib=40 ndec=6 ncg=1
XRD1 vbg vtap gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD2 vtap n3 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD3 n3 n4 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD4 n4 n5 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD5 n5 n6 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD6 n6 n7 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD7 n7 n8 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD8 n8 n9 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD9 n9 n10 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD10 n10 n11 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD11 n11 n12 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD12 n12 n13 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD13 n13 n14 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD14 n14 n15 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD15 n15 n16 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD16 n16 n17 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD17 n17 n18 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD18 n18 n19 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD19 n19 n20 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD20 n20 n21 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD21 n21 n22 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD22 n22 n23 gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
XRD23 n23 gnd gnd rhigh w=1e-6 l=10e-6 m=1
Ibias vdda nb 5u
XMB0 nb nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XMT  ntl nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m=2
XM1  na  vtap ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XM2  ng  vref ntl gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=1u ng=2 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XM3  na  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XM4  ng  na  vdda vdda sg13_hv_pmos w=4u l=1u ng=1 m=1 mm_ok={mmos}
XCG  ng  gnd cap_cmim w=50u l=50u m={ncg}
XMSF vdda ng vref gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=10u l=0.45u ng=4 m={msf} mm_ok={mmos}
XMIB vref nb gnd gnd sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=1u ng=1 m={mib} mm_ok={mmos}
XCD  vref gnd cap_cmim w=70u l=70u m={ndec}
.ends r1_refbuf
